nd","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Ember awakened by the Dark Woods. Born in a great fire and shaped by the fae, it has taken many forms—big or small, strong or feeble. Yet its malleability comes only from nature, never nurture.","abilities":["Cannot be blocked, and attacks 2 enemies simultaneously","Their true nature is revealed when inside the attack range of your units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":780,"def":350,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"burning_wick":{"slug":"burning_wick","name":"Burning Wick","icon":"/enemies-icons/Burning Wick.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Very passionate fae, burning with a even greater desire to consume all uninvited visitors, or consume itself until the last spark becomes a dim ember.","abilities":["Attacks inflict additional Burn","ATK continuously increases before its first attack, and the first attack deals a large amount of Arts damage and Burn to the target and surrounding units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.85,"stats":{"hp":15500,"atk":1000,"def":350,"res":65,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"all_flames_returned":{"slug":"all_flames_returned","name":"'All Flames Returned'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'All Flames Returned'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The ancestral Red Dragon that never left the wilderness—or perhaps it just yearns for the place where the fire is returned, like many others. New fire is added to old. Everything comes to an end, and everything is reborn anew.","abilities":["Inflicts [Burning Heart] on tiles, causing your units within to take Arts damage and Burn every second","[Desire] ASPD increases when outside your units' Attack Range.","[Return] Takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage when inside [Burning Heart]","Spin","[Gift of Fire] After performing several attacks, the next attack deals Arts damage and Burn to the target and all your surrounding units, and inflicts [Burning Heart] on affected tiles, prioritizing your units that are not in [Burning Heart]","[Firelight] Stuns and blinds the Operator with highest ATK on the field, and summons <Fires of Days Past> in the 8 surrounding tiles","Enters Rest form when HP reaches 0","Rest","Summons <Fires of Days Past> around itself and recovers HP; When HP reaches max, if there are no <Fires of Days Past> on the battlefield, enters Last Dance form, otherwise destroys all <Fires of Days Past> and returns to Spin form","Last Dance","Aerial, ATK increased","[Burn Bright] Periodically takes flight, locking onto up to two of your Operators in [Burning Heart] and dealing Arts damage and Burn to all your units in the three nearest rows around them, as well as inflicting [Burning Heart] on all affected tiles"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":78000,"atk":780,"def":550,"res":45,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.8}},"tree_wall":{"slug":"tree_wall","name":"Tree Wall","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tree Wall.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A silent fae. The path of life is closed. The path of death is closed. All paths are closed.","abilities":["Appears when your Operators are deployed in the 4 adjacent tiles around <Shield and Wall>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":45000,"atk":1250,"def":680,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":6}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"ea-ex-8.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":7,"description